    {
      "id": "6MBowPDjkUvNjZbGEdPPP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1959.009117350038,
      "y": 5229.140861316634,
      "width": 319,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 883477489,
      "version": 275,
      "versionNonce": 387833969,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769518650093,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Demo\n---\ncreateTopic(name, partitions)\ncreateProducer(name)\ncreateConsumer(name, group)\ntopic.addSubscriber(consumer,\npartition)\npublisher.publish(topic,\npartition, message)\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "4jixzzu9R9alTn2GhkpKX",
      "originalText": "Demo\n---\ncreateTopic(name, partitions)\ncreateProducer(name)\ncreateConsumer(name, group)\ntopic.addSubscriber(consumer, partition)\npublisher.publish(topic, partition, message)\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TJ2kU9KTwtD3ypodJ9AwT",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1979.1250041740366,
      "y": 4963.554926320857,
      "width": 880,
      "height": 700,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aW",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1831799313,
      "version": 937,
      "versionNonce": 143113777,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769519376188,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Group Management System\n----\nA user will be able to signup (Admin/Member)\n    Admin can only create groups\n    Members can Join\nCan create max of 10 groups\nEach group can have 100k users\nOnly admin and super admins are allowed to send messages\nAll others are viewers\nAdmin can add other members, admin can make other members as admin\nAdmin can send only text messages\n1M active users per day\n\n\nNon Functional Requirement\n----\nSay we have around 20,000 active groups\n- On an average 100 messages are send daily\n- 20,000 * 100 * 1000 = 2GB of data per day (Which is good for modern hardwares,\ngiven that they can store data in TB)\n\n- At peak, say we have 10% of DAU which is around 100k\n- We need to deliver messages to 100k users per second (Fan out problem)\n1M needs to be broadcasted to 100k users per second \n\n \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Group Management System\n----\nA user will be able to signup (Admin/Member)\n    Admin can only create groups\n    Members can Join\nCan create max of 10 groups\nEach group can have 100k users\nOnly admin and super admins are allowed to send messages\nAll others are viewers\nAdmin can add other members, admin can make other members as admin\nAdmin can send only text messages\n1M active users per day\n\n\nNon Functional Requirement\n----\nSay we have around 20,000 active groups\n- On an average 100 messages are send daily\n- 20,000 * 100 * 1000 = 2GB of data per day (Which is good for modern hardwares,\ngiven that they can store data in TB)\n\n- At peak, say we have 10% of DAU which is around 100k\n- We need to deliver messages to 100k users per second (Fan out problem)\n1M needs to be broadcasted to 100k users per second \n\n \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
