    {
      "id": "yhYSdzY7vgla7fQlU3CCo",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3416.394300590842,
      "y": 5418.006966520462,
      "width": 550,
      "height": 625,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#9c36b5",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ao",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1986222239,
      "version": 595,
      "versionNonce": 481841553,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1769522245420,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Topic: Chat\nPartition key: groupId\n\nHow may partitions needed?\n20,000 active groups\n\npartitions ≥ fan-out workers\nWe need 40-50 partitions\nEach partition is handling, 400 groups \n\n\nHow do we decide number of partitions?\n- Mostly 10MB/s is considered safe\n- If we have 100k messages per second\n- Having 1KB each = 100k * 1KB = 100MB/s\n- 100MB / 10MB = 10 partitions\n\n\n- Consumer parallelism is important\n- If we have 20 consumers, then partitions should \n    be greater than 20\n\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Topic: Chat\nPartition key: groupId\n\nHow may partitions needed?\n20,000 active groups\n\npartitions ≥ fan-out workers\nWe need 40-50 partitions\nEach partition is handling, 400 groups \n\n\nHow do we decide number of partitions?\n- Mostly 10MB/s is considered safe\n- If we have 100k messages per second\n- Having 1KB each = 100k * 1KB = 100MB/s\n- 100MB / 10MB = 10 partitions\n\n\n- Consumer parallelism is important\n- If we have 20 consumers, then partitions should \n    be greater than 20\n\n\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
